{"unit_id":"kzxheli-commits__dsh-workbuddy-pool#card-zh","repo":"kzxheli-commits/dsh-workbuddy-pool","commit":"b2eab28bfb7bb06d0a95c3de391e79ec63b396b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"WorkBuddy Pool 是 DSH Web 客户端的模型接入插件，把本机发现、扫码或导入的 WorkBuddy 账号汇成国内与国际模型池。它向 DSH 注册两个模型 provider，并通过本机回环端点转发 OpenAI Chat Completions、Responses 和 Anthropic Messages 请求。账号池支持轮换、失败切换、积分门槛、冷却及模型选择；设置页还可导入账号、查看状态并安排积分任务。适合需要在 DSH 中复用多个 WorkBuddy 账号的用户，需准备可用的 WorkBuddy / CodeBuddy 账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:109","lib/provider.js:100","lib/shim.js:39","lib/pool.js:15"]}
